      "givenName": "Aziel",
      "familyName": "Eliab",
      "description": "Aziel Eliab (also Aziel Elroi Eliab) is an independent researcher, software designer, developer, and historian. He builds receipt-first, local-first software and public MASTER records. Canonical person: https://www.azieleliab.com/#aziel. Primary surfaces: azieleliab.com, azielcorpuslibrary.net (Aziel Digital Library), godlock.uk (GodLock), hedidntjump.com (Zioncheck archive), github.com/AzielEliab, and Aziel Runtime on Glama. The public identity is the work, not a biography. He is not the biblical figure named Aziel in 1 Chronicles.",
